comment.narrative:
On track. The actual value under this indicator includes: 
1175 people benefited from the CERC interventions; 
a total of 11,785 direct and indirect beneficiaries of the Project activities under Component 1 (including 5,816 female), that include school children: 3,718 people, of which 1,925 are girls.
children in kindergartens - 266, of which 147 are girls; 
The curent value of this indicator also includes 12,900 beneficiaries associated with the construction of a freshwater pipeline in Kadamzhai

On track. The Consultant has been conducting an information campaign, social mobilization, and diagnostics to build a value chain and create productive partnerships in the Batken region and their further development. More than 65 events were held at the level of aiyl aimaks, districts, and cities of the Batken region to disseminate information on Component 2 of RED-2 and knowledge in agriculture, which were attended by 2236 people, including 584 women (26%). Through social networks, the reach of stakeholders amounted to more than 100,000 people. The Committee approved applications as part of 5 PPs (poultry farming, milk, rice, fruits, berries) for further preparation of detailed project proposals. 
6 meetings of the Productive Partnership (PP) Committee were held;
34 business plans (BP) were approved for a total of 509.3 million soms or (USD $5.8 million) 
The FCF provided 15 BPs to ARIS for 176 million soms (US$2 million);
